Final command shape:
```
gh repo clone <owner>/<repo> <dir> -- <headFlags> 2><ERRFILE> && { cd <dir><headSetup> && git fetch --no-tags --depth 200 origin main && if git merge-base --is-ancestor FETCH_HEAD HEAD; then echo "silent-update: already up to date" && exit 0; fi && git -c user.name=sm-silent-update -c user.email=sm-silent-update@users.noreply.github.com merge --no-edit FETCH_HEAD && git push <pushTarget>; } 2><ERRFILE>
